<title>USA: Salomon Bros Fund Inc sets qtly div.</title>
<headline>Salomon Bros Fund Inc sets qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers Fund Inc said it declared a distribution of $0.05 from short term capital gains and $0.16 from long term capital gains.  The distribution is to be paid on March 7 to shareholders of record on February 26.</p>
<p>The prior dividend was $0.075.  In addition to the prior dividend, the fund distributed $0.41 from short term capital gains and $1.19 from long capital term gains.</p>
